Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.77,0:00:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,快看這個  鷹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,這座島的地圖?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.95,0:00:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我想去這個打叉的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那裡有什麼東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,寶藏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,騙人的吧  怎麼可能有這種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才要去親眼驗證啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要找我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,因為你運動神經看起來很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就算遇到什麼危險
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺也有辦法應對
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此  我給你推薦個更有用的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.35,0:00:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我乃燕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.31,0:00:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你從哪冒出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.77,0:00:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,剛剛你是從樹上跳下來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,此乃秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.57,0:00:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙是忍者哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你們幾個
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好像在打什麼不好的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嚇到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫隼人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.33,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,作為班長  實在沒辦法對你們視而不見啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想  你是叫雀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我來幫忙的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,也能分到寶物嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,當然  大家一起去找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,還是肯來了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:25.18,Comment,,0,0,0,,看招看招…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是  是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我們找到的這座小島的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就裝在這個寶箱裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,然後我們都各自上了鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,四把鎖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯  因為我們有五個人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,五個人把鑰匙藏了起來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但是鎖只有四把啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.91,0:03:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,因為作為隊長的我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是負責保管這本筆記
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就沒有藏鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.20,0:03:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,隊長是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有  有什麼關係嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,成員都有誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.63,0:03:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,小雞或者狗嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:03:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,咩!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.17,0:04:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,羊?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是我生氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是正經八百的隊長啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,把鑰匙全部集齊  打開寶箱的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就能得知小島的秘密了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,所以那個秘密是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,過來過來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.61,0:04:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,這個嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,才不告訴你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,總而言之
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,四把鑰匙的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要解開筆記上的提示才能知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,暗號嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不過這都過去十年了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不管藏在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不覺得能保持當年的狀態了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,這個「海底上」如果指的是大海海底的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那就根本沒法拿到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我覺得大家都是好好考慮過才藏起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.23,0:04:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,比如說…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,實在看不出會有鑰匙藏著啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:04:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:05:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,「海神」到底是什麼意思呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.65,0:05:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,「海神」如果指的是大海的神
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那應該會有什麼雕像之類的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.11,0:05:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我繞著小島轉了一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,沒發現類似的東西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,海神…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大海的神…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,守護大海的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,要說守護大海的話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是燈塔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,姆啾?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是你認識的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我是鷹原羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,這位是久島鷗咩…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,咩?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.73,0:05:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂  不對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我是久島鷗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我是紬·文德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你在收集垃圾嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我也來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,唉?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,姆啾…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:06:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你們都是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊  你們在找鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒看到過呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎  我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼說的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,難道是在燈塔周圍的海底嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.10,0:06:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真是那樣的話  可以宣告沒戲了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,海神守護的海底上…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定是有著別的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你說的是「怪人」嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:37.16,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs30}註 : 「怪人」與「海神」同音
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,戰隊特攝裡會出現的那種
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,對  沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,應該不至於是怪人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.09,0:06:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不過  如果除了海神
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,海底也有別的意思的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.09,0:06:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,請問這裡有字典嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真的會在這種地方嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我的推理沒錯的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,找到鑰匙了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,果然沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,「階梯」也就是樓梯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.59,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35}注 : 「階梯」與「海底」同音
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,「海神」守護的「階梯」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就是指供奉大海守護神神社的石梯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我可沒聽說過這種說法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了  鑰匙還在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,多虧了羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的  希望能給些簡單的提示啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.11,0:07:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就是就是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你送我過來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:07:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那明天見了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.16,0:08:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,也有可能是後天哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就算後天不行  那還有大後天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,無論去到哪裡  那都還有明天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,衝啊衝啊加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,這是在唱什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,總而言之  等你什麼時候又有興致了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.73,0:08:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,再來幫我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.28,0:08:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡也沒有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,「在看門狗沉睡的冥府入口」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,活了十年以上的狗嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,這座島上還剩幾隻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,或許是這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,火葬場?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.15,0:09:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,冥府入口指的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.11,0:09:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然有點不尊重逝者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.79,0:09:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了  羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,第二把鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.46,0:09:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.13,0:09:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,下一把
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:41.14,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs28}注 : 巴西利斯克（Basilisk）又叫蛇尾雞或者有翼蜥蜴  在希臘和歐洲的傳說裡  是所有蛇類之王  並且能以眼神致人於死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,「在巴西利斯克聚集的沙漠裡」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,巴西利斯克是長得像鳥的怪物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,鳥群聚集的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,會不會是指的是雞舍之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,養雞的人家?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我記得是有幾家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,最好是養得很多的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是鳴瀨家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他家有一間很大的雞舍  應該養了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是  是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,鳴瀨?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,之前在小賣鋪前遇到過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你們關係都好到能去她家了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真有兩下子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.69,0:10:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,說到鳴瀨家的白羽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.36,0:10:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我上島以來的老相識了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真行啊你…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有事?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那  那個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫鷹原羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.67,0:10:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不認識
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,呃  那啥…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,白羽在家嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,白羽?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,叫得這麼親
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是她的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一群外人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,根本不行嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的認識她嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道她家有這麼個老爺子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我說  那孩子穿的是校服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.63,0:11:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,只要穿成那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.09,0:11:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,老爺爺會不會相信我們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,把我們當做她在學校的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,態度可能會變一些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你想幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.35,0:11:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有辦法拿到嗎  校服
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,蒼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的校服借給我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,啥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的校服借給我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼  不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友很憧憬
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.45,0:12:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,她說特別可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有…  我也不是偶像什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,被人憧憬的話也不知道怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我說的是校服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.67,0:12:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣我也是夢幻的女學生了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來挺緊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,特別是胸…咳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,胸咳?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.89,0:12:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,沒…沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你就當做突發惡疾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.15,0:12:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼  又是你們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.45,0:12:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,白羽  你朋友來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不  也不至於呃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.26,0:13:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我是久島鷗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼看起來能藏東西的地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.16,0:13:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有個女孩子呢  還是裸體
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你要找的就是那個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.04,0:13:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是第三把了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.59,0:13:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,這是打開藏有小島秘密寶箱的鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,聽起來很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.48,0:13:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那要不要一起來尋寶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,突然這麼叫她肯定會不知所措吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直都是那樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.66,0:14:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不用在意的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.91,0:14:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不過怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是叫鬍鬚貓團吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我大概知道為什麼會選你當隊長了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你有一股莫名的行動力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有  你太誇我了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,想要交朋友罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.97,0:14:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,以前的我內向到不敢和人搭話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,10年前  父母擔心這樣的我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.02,0:14:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,所以把我送到了夏令營
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,一開始我特別不願意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,周圍的人都建成自己的圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,而我卻沒法融入其中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那時  我在爸爸的房間發現了一幅地圖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸是學者
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:15:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像在調查這座小島的歷史
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那幅地圖被小心地鎖在抽屜的最裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,地圖上有個紅叉的圖案
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,旁邊有簡單的注釋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就是寶藏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但是要去那裡需要翻過山
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.23,0:15:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就算我想去  大人們肯定會反對
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,直接我找了或者試著找了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真現實啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他的名字是鷹
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然有點可怕但很擅長運動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,接著燕  隼人  雀也加入了我們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,變成了5人的團體
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有什麼在意的地方嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我似乎有過類似的經歷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看來羽依里也探險過呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:15:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.19,0:16:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,「在海雕居住的天空城堡裡」嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我們的推理越來越準了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣就第四把了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,對  鑰匙全都找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.47,0:16:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,起床啦  羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,已經早晨了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,早安  羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,早…安
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.23,0:16:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.69,0:16:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因為是我才讓羽依里受傷的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,所以作為賠禮來照顧羽依里一段時間
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.53,0:17:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你的好意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但這身打扮是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟鏡子阿姨說想來幫忙…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.46,0:17:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她就對我說穿這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.47,0:17:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣  很合身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是挺合身的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.47,0:17:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那我從今天開始加油啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,她真能幹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里  我來給你搓背哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:17:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:17:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,這還問為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,當然是來幫忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不用那麼害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,反正裹著毛巾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,沒裹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.19,0:18:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那…反正機會難得就幫你搓個背吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.65,0:18:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要裹上毛巾哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.03,0:18:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.37,0:18:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,難道不是不在意嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,果然還是抱歉  我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.17,0:18:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼  我要打開寶箱了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這是你之前提到過的地圖嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了  還在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.69,0:18:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,鷗…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,其實我本來以為很難找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但是有羽依里的幫助
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我才能找到它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你  羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼到底是什麼東西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你們找到的東西  小島的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我還以為就放在這個寶箱裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我們找到的東西可裝不進這個箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.14,0:19:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有那麼大嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,特別大的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.73,0:19:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那可真是厲害的財寶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.28,0:19:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.99,0:19:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你看就寫在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,船?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.12,0:19:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟這裡是島  有船也不奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是一般的船
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.83,0:19:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:19:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不會再上同樣的當
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,吊起我興趣然後說才不告訴你對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這次我是真打算告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.89,0:20:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼  是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,真的真的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.89,0:20:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那我很想聽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.11,0:20:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就告訴你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.36,0:20:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那我重新開始說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我們沿著地圖  去向小島偏僻的角落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.45,0:20:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,翻過大山  穿過洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真是一趟漫長的旅途
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.67,0:20:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,然後我們找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.55,0:20:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,海盜船
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,海盜船是那種
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,畫著骷髏記號的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,對的  就是那種海盜船
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有骷髏記號
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,像是在歐洲那種地方的船
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.49,0:21:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你騙人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.69,0:21:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,沒騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.61,0:21:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那時我們找到了船
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.03,0:21:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但是遇到了一些情況
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,需要立即返回
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,然後第二天夏令營也結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,大家就各奔東西了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.00,0:21:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說  你們發現之後就直接離開了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.09,0:21:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你說的是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.68,0:21:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,船現在說不定還在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.97,0:21:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,一定還在的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那一天  發現海盜船的我們做了約定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.81,0:21:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,約好10年後  再一起尋找那艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,然後就分開了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.73,0:21:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你現在又來尋找嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就在10年後的這個夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.45,0:21:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.95,0:21:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,鑰匙和地圖都還在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我一定要去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,再一次去到那個有海盜船的地方
Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Comment,,0,0,0,,
